.Dd October 25, 2026
.Dt PATINA-SCREENSHOT 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm patina-screenshot
.Nd the Patina desktop's screenshot, recording and screen sharing choices
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -no-window
.Nm
.Fl -recording
.Nm
.Fl -share
.Nm
.Fl h | V
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is what the Print key opens: a pill at the bottom of the screen offering
the whole screen, the window that was focused, or a selection, a part of
the screen dragged out with the pointer; then recording the screen, or a
selection.
A click or Enter takes the one under the pointer or the keyboard;
the arrows and Tab move between them, and 1 to 5 choose one outright.
Escape, the close button, or the keyboard going elsewhere closes it
without taking anything.
.Pp
It prints the choice,
.Dq screen ,
.Dq window ,
.Dq selection ,
.Dq record-screen
or
.Dq record-selection ,
and exits; closed, it prints nothing.
.Xr patina-compositor 1 ,
which runs it, then takes the screenshot itself, once it's gone, and saves
it in
.Pa ~/Pictures/Screenshots ,
or starts recording into
.Pa ~/Videos/Screen Recordings
with
.Xr ffmpeg 1 .
For a selection, the compositor dims the screen under a crosshair: drag
out the part to take or record and let go.
Escape, another button, or a click without a drag takes nothing.
.Pp
While the screen is recorded,
.Nm
.Fl -recording
shows it at the bottom of the screen, with the time and a Stop button;
Stop, or the Print key again, ends the recording.
.Pp
With
.Fl -share ,
it is the chooser
.Xr xdg-desktop-portal-wlr 5
runs when an app asks to share the screen: it lists the screen and the
windows the portal gives it, and the app sees only the one chosen.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -no-window
Offer no window, for when none is focused.
.It Fl -recording
Show that the screen is being recorded, until standard input closes;
Stop prints
.Dq stop .
The pill is left out of the recording.
.It Fl -share
Read the portal's sources on standard input, a line each,
.Ql Monitor: Ar name ...
or
.Ql Window: Ar title Pq Ar identifier ,
and print the line chosen; nothing if it's closed with Escape.
.It Fl h , -help
Print a short usage message.
.It Fl V , -version
Print the version.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /etc/xdg/xdg-desktop-portal-wlr/Patina
Makes
.Nm
.Fl -share
the portal's chooser; installed by the desktop.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ffmpeg 1 ,
.Xr patina-compositor 1 ,
.Xr xdg-desktop-portal-wlr 5 ,
.Xr patina-desktop 7
